  "title": "Florida National Guard and Search and Rescue Conduct Missions Following Hurricane Isaias",
  "description": "Florida Army National Guard Soldiers with Bravo Company, 1st Battalion, 185th Assault Helicopter Battalion and Search and Rescue personnel depart Tallahassee International Airport on UH-60 Black Hawk utility helicopters to survey damage and scan for anyone needing assistance following Hurricane Isaias in Tallahassee, Florida, Oct. 10, 2026. Throughout the day and across the state, the Florida National Guard will be actively engaged in missions to include search and rescue, law-enforcement support, humanitarian assistance and more. (Florida Army National Guard Video by Sgt. Marc Morgenstern, 107th MPAD)",
